	(descr "Solder point for a Semitec JT thin film thermistor (103JT-025 and the longer lengths): two flat tin plated leads, 0.5x0.17 mm, 1.8 mm pitch, 5 mm long. Insert the leads through the 0.8 mm holes or lap-solder them on the oval pads from either side. Keep the iron away from the film: Semitec limits the sensor film to 150 C. Dimensions per Semitec JT Thermistor data sheet.")
